WEBVTT

00:08:02.353 --> 00:08:05.397
To truly understand
DNA decision-making,

00:08:05.439 --> 00:08:09.193
we need to see the process
of knot formation in atomic detail.

00:08:09.944 --> 00:08:12.655
Even the most powerful
microscopes can't see this.

00:08:14.281 --> 00:08:16.992
What if we tried
to simulate these on a computer?

00:08:17.785 --> 00:08:21.288
For that we'd need
a million computers to do that.

00:08:22.122 --> 00:08:25.376
That's exactly what we have
at Los Alamos Labs --

00:08:25.417 --> 00:08:28.504
a million computers
connected in a giant warehouse.